> Formulas, named cells, money and dates. A chart is one line in the head.

---

## :waves: We got Sankeys baby!

```sheet
---
chart: sankey
lock: C1:C5, E7:E9
---
From | To | Amount:number | Assumption:name | Value:number
--- | --- | --- | --- | ---
Monthly donors | Fund | =monthly_donors*average_gift | Monthly donors | 120
One-off gifts | Fund | =one_off_gifts | Average gift | 15
Fund | Grants | =fund*grant_share/100 | One-off gifts | 900
Fund | Admin | =admin | Grant share | 80
Fund | Reserve | =fund-grants-admin | Admin | 150
| |  |  |  |
| |  |  | Fund | =SUMIF(B1:B20, "Fund", C1:C20)
| |  |  | Grants | =SUMIF(B1:B20, "Grants", C1:C20)
| |  |  | Reserve | =SUMIF(B1:B20, "Reserve", C1:C20)
{big=Grants}
```

> A Sankey of a mutual aid fund's month. Change an assumption and the flows redraw.

---

## :calculator: Tip Splitting Calculator

```calc
food = 164.50
drinks = 58
tip = (food + drinks) * 18%
total = food + drinks + tip
total / 6
```

> A tape: an expression a line, a name for any answer. It also graphs curves.

---

## :pencil: Drawing Tool

```draw
---
alt: A browser asks a server, which reads the data.
---
Kind | X | Y | W | H | Style | Label
--- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | ---
o | 4 | 6 | 16 | 8 | 1b | Browser
o | 32 | 6 | 16 | 8 | 1b | Server
c | 60 | 5 | 14 | 10 | 1g | Data
k | 0 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 0 | asks
k | 1 | 2 | 0 | 0 | 0 | reads
```

> Shapes, arrows, icons and pixel art, on an 8px grid. The alt text travels with it.

---

## :workflow: Diagram Maker

```diagram
---
kind: mind
---
- Launch :rocket:
  - Product
    - Pricing
    - Onboarding
    - The first ten customers
  - Marketing
    - Press
    - Social
    - A launch-day post
  - Support
    - Help pages
    - Who answers, and when

~ A launch-day post -> Help pages: links to
```

> Mind maps, org charts, family trees, swimlanes, timelines, Venns, seating charts and networks, each from a list.

